      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FIRE AND PASSION (1) is back in peak form having put three wins together at this circuit. Has overcame much wider barriers in each of those wins and should enjoy a lovely run from the ace draw. That gives him every chance to deliver again. MOVE IT LOU NZ (4) led from this barrier and fought well to miss narrowly as runner-up when resuming last start, beaten a head. Has won when second-up before so should be improved. Could challenge. BITE THE EAR MIKE (8) landed a hat trick of wins at this circuit earlier in his campaign and could be close to another success after placing in his last three outings, the last two behind FIRE AND PASSION. Draws to stalk him tonight. ALWAYSBJOY NZ (6) came from the back row for third when resuming at Marburg. Draws wide but should strip fitter and strikes at 50 per cent here.",
